        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Table 2 displays the score ranges that correspond to the qualitative descriptions in Table 1. A score of 86 and higher for CCTST OVERALL indicates a superior score. This score is currently earned by approximately 15% of the undergraduate national sample (2018). Scores of 69 and lower display weak overall skill or no manifestation of critical thinking skills, and have been associated with poor performance educationally, in the workplace, and on professional licensure examination.</div>
